    "https://damminhtien.github.io/ontology-research/ontology/middle/assertion#Assertion": {
      "comment": "One reified statement about the world — a derived information object, never an event. core:describes names a resolved subject; assertion:subjectReference names a pending noncanonical subject. assertion:predicate names the relation IRI, the object is an entity or location (assertion:hasObject) or a literal (assertion:literalValue), core:validFrom/core:validUntil carry half-open valid time, core:hasSource cites Sources, and assertion:evidence carries inline source locators.",
      "kind": "class",
      "label": "Assertion",
